; Refetch timing for tb_fetch (engine 0, START_PC 128, D82): pin 0 toggles every clock at
; CLKDIV 0, 62 times per pass, and the JMP back takes 3 clocks (itself and the refetch bubble).
; The testbench writes the program memories while it runs: a write to engine 0's memory must
; cost exactly 2 clocks (the two refetches of BUG-074), one to engine 1's memory none.
        PIN  0, DRV0
